module shared.lemmas

import shared.entities

// Lemmas for `verify --prove`: facts that rule out the states a counterexample to induction
// starts from. `check` checks them; `verify` runs no TLC cone for them. This file loads last,
// so the rules of the other files keep their names.

// A liability case completes no claim before negotiation, so a case between
// OpenSettlement's two steps has no completed claim for its new settlement to break
// 「賠償の請求は示談書がそろってから完了する」.
forbidden(Claim, ClaimCase, Claim.completed_on == present, ClaimCase.status in (received, responded, investigating), ClaimCase.coverage in (bodily_liability, property_liability)).along(Claim, ClaimCase).label("賠償責任の事故は示談交渉の前に請求を完了しない").lemma()
